    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, poet. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστίζω</span> in pres. and
		impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whip,
			scourge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάστιε νῦν</span>”
